            <div xml:id="d1171">

                <pb facs="0965" n="955" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg955"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.0093/4–3049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-04-30T11:00:00+08:00">April 30, 1949—11
                            a. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 30—9 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>735. ReDeptel 212, April 15, Contel 654, April 19. Registered letter sent express
                    today to Peiping General Headquarters, People’s Liberation Army, along lines
                    indicated Department’s reference telegram.</p>
                <p>Passed Nanking 468, Canton 90, Shanghai 498.</p>
                <closer>[<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubb</hi>
                    </signed>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
